#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr ""

